ThreeIsland_House3_Text_WantedToLiveSomewhereQuiet::
    .string "I built bridges, once. Every bolt\n"
    .string "I signed for, I saw the bridge fall.\p"
    .string "I bought this house because nothing\n"
    .string "here is high enough to fall.\p"
    .string "I still check the door three times.\n"
    .string "If it were open, anything at all\l"
    .string "could come in.$"

